From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 23:09:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2032/3799] soh: rename func_808B5B58 ->
 BgSpot16Bombstone_SetupFly

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: zeroes the flight timer and installs the debris flight action
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot16_Bombstone/z_bg_spot16_bombstone.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 .../actors/ovl_Bg_Spot16_Bombstone/z_bg_spot16_bombstone.c | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot16_Bombstone/z_bg_spot16_bombstone.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot16_Bombstone/z_bg_spot16_bombstone.c
index 95463ef40..ca059f4d6 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot16_Bombstone/z_bg_spot16_bombstone.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot16_Bombstone/z_bg_spot16_bombstone.c
@@ -17,7 +17,8 @@ void BgSpot16Bombstone_Explode(BgSpot16Bombstone* this, PlayState* play);  // wa
 // LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_808B5B04: holds until the bombiwa object is loaded, then starts the debris flight
 void BgSpot16Bombstone_WaitForObject(BgSpot16Bombstone* this, PlayState* play);  // was func_808B5B04 [LLM:HIGH]
 void func_808B5B6C(BgSpot16Bombstone* this, PlayState* play);
-void func_808B5B58(BgSpot16Bombstone* this);
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_808B5B58: zeroes the flight timer and installs the debris flight action
+void BgSpot16Bombstone_SetupFly(BgSpot16Bombstone* this);  // was func_808B5B58 [LLM:HIGH]
 // LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_808B5950: pushes the player out, watches their bomb, and on AC_HIT spawns the debris, sets the switch and event flags and blows up
 void BgSpot16Bombstone_Idle(BgSpot16Bombstone* this, PlayState* play);  // was func_808B5950 [LLM:HIGH]
 // LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_808B5934: restores the draw function and installs the idle action
@@ -499,12 +500,12 @@ void BgSpot16Bombstone_SetupWaitForObject(BgSpot16Bombstone* this) {
 
 void BgSpot16Bombstone_WaitForObject(BgSpot16Bombstone* this, PlayState* play) {
     if (Object_IsLoaded(&play->objectCtx, this->bombiwaBankIndex)) {
-        func_808B5B58(this);
+        BgSpot16Bombstone_SetupFly(this);  // was func_808B5B58 [LLM:HIGH]
         this->actor.draw = BgSpot16Bombstone_Draw;
     }
 }
 
-void func_808B5B58(BgSpot16Bombstone* this) {
+void BgSpot16Bombstone_SetupFly(BgSpot16Bombstone* this) {
     this->unk_154 = 0;
     this->actionFunc = func_808B5B6C;
 }
